   "source": [
    "## 3. 基於統計規則的偵測\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 四分位距法 (IQR Rule)\n",
    "\n",
    "這是與箱型圖背後原理相同的方法。一個數據點如果小於 `Q1 - 1.5 * IQR` 或大於 `Q3 + 1.5 * IQR`，就被視為異常值。\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Q1**: 第一四分位數 (25th percentile)\n",
    "- **Q3**: 第三四分位數 (75th percentile)\n",
    "- **IQR**: 四分位距 (Interquartile Range) = Q3 - Q1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "concimg-03_outlier_detection-f3",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": [
     "concept-image"
    ]
   },
   "source": [
    "<!-- concept-image:03_outlier_detection_fig3 -->\n",
    "<div align=\"center\">\n",
    "<img src=\"concept_images/03_outlier_detection_fig3_zscore_20260611_180837.png\" alt=\"Z-Score 方法：標準差單位的距離判定\" width=\"640\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">\n",
    "<br><sub>圖 3 · Z-Score 方法：標準差單位的距離判定</sub>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "9452e488",
   "metadata": {},
